    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a perfectly valid way to end the performance\"... you really think so? i've always been told that life is about persevering, that you always have to keep moving. but looking at it from the outside, it just feels like i'm dragging out a conclusion that's already been reached. if i'm not serving a purpose, why am i supposed to keep fighting to stay here?",
